        "content": "## ⚙️ Autoscaler Configuration\n\n| Setting | Value |\n|---------|-------|\n| **Scale UP threshold** | CPU > 70% |\n| **Scale DOWN threshold** | CPU < 30% |\n| **Min Replicas** | 1 |\n| **Max Replicas** | 10 |\n| **Cooldown** | 60 seconds |\n| **Check interval** | Every 2 minutes |\n\n### 📋 Scale Events\nKhi CPU vượt ngưỡng, autoscaler sẽ:\n- **CPU > 70%** → Thêm 1 replica (tối đa 10)\n- **CPU < 30%** → Giảm 1 replica (tối thiểu 1)",
